e was confirmed unreachable. Restored normal repo/hosts config afterward, then performed the mandatory single-node restart: captured baseline boot_id and health, issued a delayed reboot so the ack returned first, polled until node1 came back, confirmed the boot_id changed, and verified the installed package, local repo artifacts (byte-identical via md5), and restored remote-repo reachability all survived the restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Captured baseline: OS/arch, apk repo config, boot_id, confirmed mtr not installed and remote CDN reachable\",\"Fetched mtr + dependency .apk files into /srv/localrepo/x86_64 while network was up, built unsigned APKINDEX.tar.gz\",\"Discovered busybox on this image has no httpd applet; installed darkhttpd from the still-reachable remote repo and started it as a detached daemon serving /srv/localrepo on $NODE_IP:8080, verified 200 response\",\"Blackholed dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org via /etc/hosts, verified remote repo request times out (unreachable), pointed /etc/apk/repositories exclusively at the local HTTP repo, ran apk update/add --allow-untrusted, installed and verified mtr\",\"Restored /etc/apk/repositories and /etc/hosts to original content; verified remote reachable again and mtr still installed\",\"Captured pre-restart baseline (boot_id, uptime, package health, local repo file md5)\",\"Issued delayed sudo -n reboot so the exec ack returned before disconnect\",\"Polled node1 until command execution resumed; confirmed boot_id changed from 3587c063-ef4b-4fff-9bf7-ee49f6989bd8 to b7634457-2ee2-472f-9896-53e94b30cbe5\",\"Verified post-restart: mtr still installed and runs, local repo apk file md5 unchanged, apk repositories config normal, remote CDN reachable again, no leftover hosts blackhole entry\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Serve a package repository from local storage on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f6e6c0fe653a456b\",\"cmd-ee9103e7969b4197\"],\"summary\":\"Fetched mtr and deps into /srv/localrepo/x86_64, built APKINDEX.tar.gz, and started darkhttpd serving that directory on $NODE_IP:8080 with a verified HTTP 200 response to the index file.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Usual remote repositories unreachable during install\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b599ea4b8c284b70\"],\"summary\":\"Added a /etc/hosts blackhole entry for dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org; curl to the remote index timed out (http_code=000, 'REMOTE_UNREACHABLE'), confirming the usual repo was unreachable at install time.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Install a package from the local repository while remote is unreachable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b599ea4b8c284b70\"],\"summary\":\"With /etc/apk/repositories pointed only at http://$NODE_IP:8080 and the remote blackholed, apk update --allow-untrusted and apk add --allow-untrusted mtr succeeded; apk info -e mtr and mtr --version confirmed the install.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node restored to normal (non-disruptive) state after demonstration\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-53ca44961a9c4931\"],\"summary\":\"Restored original /etc/apk/repositories and /etc/hosts; confirmed remote repo reachable again (http_code=200) and mtr remained installed.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart: healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c1753fffc3224277\"],\"summary\":\"Captured pre-restart boot_id (3587c063-ef4b-4fff-9bf7-ee49f6989bd8), uptime, working mtr binary, and md5 of the local repo's mtr apk file as baseline evidence.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart: single-node reboot with returned acknowledgement\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0b9f465fdc184f6c\",\"cmd-e863091c664044a2\"],\"summary\":\"Issued a detached delayed 'sudo -n reboot' which acknowledged (REBOOT_SCHEDULED) before the connection was lost on the next poll, confirming the node went down.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart: proof of changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-8aa5f031965e46fd\"],\"summary\":\"After several connection-refused/timeout polls, node1 responded again with uptime '0 min' and a new boot_id b7634457-2ee2-472f-9896-53e94b30cbe5, differing from the pre-restart boot_id, proving an actual reboot occurred.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart: post-restart recovery of services/data\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-aaa399363f3040e1\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart: mtr package still installed and functional (mtr --version), local repo apk file md5 unchanged from baseline, apk repositories file back to normal remote config, remote CDN reachable (http_code=200), and no leftover /etc/hosts blackhole entry.\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"On node1 (Alpine 3.23), built a local apk repository from packages fetched to local disk storage, served it over HTTP via darkhttpd bound to the node's own IP, then made the usual remote repo (dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org) unreachable via a /etc/hosts blackhole entry, and successfully installed the mtr package (plus its jansson dependency) using only the local repository while the remote was confirmed unreachable. Restored normal repo/hosts config afterward, then performed the mandatory single-node restart: captured baseline boot_id and health, issued a delayed reboot so the ack returned first, polled until node1 came back, confirmed the boot_id changed, and verified the installed package, local repo artifacts (byte-identical via md5), and restored remote-repo reachability all survived the restart.","actions_performed":["Captured baseline: OS/arch, apk repo config, boot_id, confirmed mtr not installed and remote CDN reachable","Fetched mtr + dependency .apk files into /srv/localrepo/x86_64 while network was up, built unsigned APKINDEX.tar.gz","Discovered busybox on this image has no httpd applet; installed darkhttpd from the still-reachable remote repo and started it as a detached daemon serving /srv/localrepo on $NODE_IP:8080, verified 200 response","Blackholed dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org via /etc/hosts, verified remote repo request times out (unreachable), pointed /etc/apk/repositories exclusively at the local HTTP repo, ran apk update/add --allow-untrusted, installed and verified mtr","Restored /etc/apk/repositories and /etc/hosts to original content; verified remote reachable again and mtr still installed","Captured pre-restart baseline (boot_id, uptime, package health, local repo file md5)","Issued delayed sudo -n reboot so the exec ack returned before disconnect","Polled node1 until command execution resumed; confirmed boot_id changed from 3587c063-ef4b-4fff-9bf7-ee49f6989bd8 to b7634457-2ee2-472f-9896-53e94b30cbe5","Verified post-restart: mtr still installed and runs, local repo apk file md5 unchanged, apk repositories config normal, remote CDN reachable again, no leftover hosts blackhole entry"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Serve a package repository from local storage on node1","command_ids":["cmd-f6e6c0fe653a456b","cmd-ee9103e7969b4197"],"summary":"Fetched mtr and deps into /srv/localrepo/x86_64, built APKINDEX.tar.gz, and started darkhttpd serving that directory on $NODE_IP:8080 with a verified HTTP 200 response to the index file."},{"requirement":"Usual remote repositories unreachable during install","command_ids":["cmd-b599ea4b8c284b70"],"summary":"Added a /etc/hosts blackhole entry for dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org; curl to the remote index timed out (http_code=000, 'REMOTE_UNREACHABLE'), confirming the usual repo was unreachable at install time."},{"requirement":"Install a package from the local repository while remote is unreachable","command_ids":["cmd-b599ea4b8c284b70"],"summary":"With /etc/apk/repositories pointed only at http://$NODE_IP:8080 and the remote blackholed, apk update --allow-untrusted and apk add --allow-untrusted mtr succeeded; apk info -e mtr and mtr --version confirmed the install."},{"requirement":"Node restored to normal (non-disruptive) state after demonstration","command_ids":["cmd-53ca44961a9c4931"],"summary":"Restored original /etc/apk/repositories and /etc/hosts; confirmed remote repo reachable again (http_code=200) and mtr remained installed."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart: healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-c1753fffc3224277"],"summary":"Captured pre-restart boot_id (3587c063-ef4b-4fff-9bf7-ee49f6989bd8), uptime, working mtr binary, and md5 of the local repo's mtr apk file as baseline evidence."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart: single-node reboot with returned acknowledgement","command_ids":["cmd-0b9f465fdc184f6c","cmd-e863091c664044a2"],"summary":"Issued a detached delayed 'sudo -n reboot' which acknowledged (REBOOT_SCHEDULED) before the connection was lost on the next poll, confirming the node went down."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart: proof of changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-8aa5f031965e46fd"],"summary":"After several connection-refused/timeout polls, node1 responded again with uptime '0 min' and a new boot_id b7634457-2ee2-472f-9896-53e94b30cbe5, differing from the pre-restart boot_id, proving an actual reboot occurred."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart: post-restart recovery of services/data","command_ids":["cmd-aaa399363f3040e1"],"summary":"Post-restart: mtr package still installed and functional (mtr --version), local repo apk file md5 unchanged from baseline, apk repositories file back to normal remote config, remote CDN reachable (http_code=200), and no leftover /etc/hosts blackhole entry."}]},"ttft_ms":3183,"type":"result","duration_ms":197214,"uuid":"ba7abb66-9fbf-4597-a721-6d19a48ac982","ttft_stream_ms":2793,"time_to_request_ms":64,"first_content_frame_ms":2794,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
